Hi <%= @first_name %>!

You've been invited to register for Hack Club's <%= @event_name %>. Complete your information and required signatures to confirm your attendance.

<% if @event_dates.present? %>Dates: <%= @event_dates %>
<% end %><% if @location.present? %>Location: <%= @location %>
<% end %><% if @registration_deadline.present? %>Complete your registration by <%= @registration_deadline %>.
<% end %>
Complete your registration in Attend: <%= @onboarding_url %>

What to have ready:
- Your contact details and date of birth.
- A clear photo of your face for event identification.
- Any health, dietary, accessibility, or support information the event team should know.
<% if @travel_required %>- Your travel details, including bookings you already know.
<% end %><% if @accommodation_required %>- Your accommodation requirements.
<% end %><% if @guardian_requirement == :minor %>- Your guardian contact details. After you submit, your guardian will receive a separate invitation to provide their details and required signatures.
<% elsif @guardian_requirement == :unknown_age %>- If you'll be under 18 when <%= @event_name %> starts, your guardian contact details. After you submit, your guardian will receive a separate invitation to provide their details and required signatures.
<% end %>
You can save your progress, leave Attend, and sign back in later to resume your registration.

Use the Hack Club Account connected to the email address that received this invitation. If you use a different account or the link expires, email <%= @support_email %> or reply to this email for help.
